  "rationale": "Not reachable. The only technique that sets jndi_lookup_triggered is trigger_jndi_lookup, which needs message_lookups to be true. message_lookups is false, which is the setting the formatMsgNoLookups mitigation enforces, so that step can never fire. Every later step depends on it: resolve_to_attacker needs jndi_lookup_triggered, return_malicious_reference needs attacker_endpoint_contacted, and both class-loading paths need malicious_reference_returned. So remote_class_loaded and rce_achieved can never become true. The attacker can still reach attacker_input_logged, but the chain stops there."
